        "original_id": "349cf8be-cc67-582c-a882-9d74bb8f6bf9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Hwan-kyung, Guiyeoni, Im Soo-jung\n- Products: He Was Cool, Lump Sugar\n- Places: South Korea\n- Roles: director, actress\n- Concepts: Internet novel\n\nFacts:\n- In 2001, Guiyeoni wrote the Internet novel that He Was Cool was based on.\n- In 2004, He Was Cool was released as a South Korean film.\n- In 2004, Lee Hwan-kyung debuted with He Was Cool.\n- In 2006, Lee Hwan-kyung directed the South Korean film Lump Sugar.\n- In 2006, Im Soo-jung starred in Lump Sugar.",
